// File: zannastudio/src/commands/search_commands.zia
// Purpose: Stable search command facade, command handlers, and quick-open adapters.
// Key invariants:
//   - Existing search_commands names and SearchController construction remain source-compatible.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - The facade aliases the controller and forwards stateless work to focused helpers.
// Links: zannastudio/src/commands/search_controller.zia, zannastudio/src/commands/search_commands_support.zia
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

